# boot tracking over the SDR relay: the measured boot, sealed and published
spell bootattest
version 0.1.0
book networking
genre aggregation
origin first-party
provides boot-attestation
provides boot-report-wire
provides measurement-binding
requires sdr-transport
requires libc
requires sha256
source wubu_boot_attest.c
source wubu_boot_attest.h
test wubu_boot_attest_test.c
